 as illustrative worked examples
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Phase 14 batch B3 (audit 2026-09-01, Phase 4 case-study authenticity).
No named customer, contract, or measured dataset exists for the 13 case
studies (owner decision 2026-09-02: relabel as worked examples rather than
remove). Every case-study page and blog case study now:
- carries the kicker 'Worked example' and a title prefixed 'Worked example:'
- opens with the disclosure that the figures are modelled from typical
  programme parameters and vendor datasheets, not a named customer's results
- replaces 'customer's own shipped or measured value' / 'NDA' wording with
  modelled wording; an 'About this example' brief item states the basis
- /case-studies/ hub, pillar JSON, homepage card, menu labels and the
  sample-pack card use 'Worked examples — programme templates'
- fixes the footer link '/case-studies//' -> '/case-studies/'
